WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
From Mountain, step the feet wide and turn the toes slightly in.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Hinge forward and walk both hands toward the right foot.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Lengthen the left side body as the crown reaches down.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Keep both sit bones lifting and the neck soft.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold, walk hands to center, then to the left side.
